["TEXT","e429",130,690,0,"VDDIOSA/B = switched 1.8 V for the two SiP PSRAMs; VDDIOSC = always-on 1.8 V for SiP NOR.","small",0]
["TEXT","e430",130,666,0,"VIOA feeds both the external NOR bus and display/control PA12-93 signals. Do not change to 1.8 V with PY25Q128HA.","small",0]
["TEXT","e431",130,642,0,"A future 1.8 V-only panel requires level translation or a compatible Flash/bank remap; its exact FPC is still pending.","small",0]
["TEXT","e432",130,618,0,"USB/audio/DSI power bypass follows the reference, although those functions are disabled in this offline revision.","small",0]
["TEXT","e433",130,594,0,"Each capacitor has an associated BGA ball in its engineering note; place locally, not as one remote bulk capacitor bank.","small",0]
["TEXT","e434",130,570,0,"GPADC/AUD/SDM reference nodes are capacitor-only; they are not external power inputs.","small",0]
